	quest.09A939B53E1F4E94.quest_desc: [
		"Contracts are single target missions to kill a named mob."
		""
		"They will spawn 50 blocks away in a random directions and will have backup."
		""
		"You have once chance to kill a target, if the target is killed by anything other than yourself you will be unable to claim the reward. Some projectile based weapons may fail to count as your kill. A melee weapon will be the best choice to ensure a confirmed kill."
		""
		"Contracts will be unlocked as you complete bounties."
		""
		"Good luck."
	]
