	quest.1998F4B1A5B40B08.quest_desc: [
		"There are several ways of making money in Apocalpyse Industries."
		""
		"&nExporting&r"
		""
		"There are over 400 items and fluids that can be sold using Exporters."
		"You can press Left Alt whilst hovering on an item to view the buy and/or sell price. Fluids are priced per mB."
		"In JEI type #sellable to see the full list of items that can be sold."
		""
		"&nQuests&r"
		""
		"You will earn money as you complete quests. "
		"Keep an eye out for &oSpecial Requests&r and &oBounties&r!"
		""
		"&nSpecial Requests&r"
		""
		"In the &oSpecial Requests&r chapter of the quest book you can see themed tasks."
		"As you progress through the quest book Special Requests will come in wanting to purchase a large amount of items. "
		"These will yield a higher premium compared to regular exporting, so they are worth checking out."
		""
		"&nBounties&r"
		""
		"&oBounties&r are available where you will be tasked to kill a certain mob or a certain number of mobs."
		"As you progress through bounties, special contracts will become available where you will face off againsts a named target."
		"Warning: you will have one chance per contract to take out the target, failing to kill them yourself will result in no payout!"
	]
	quest.1998F4B1A5B40B08.quest_subtitle: "Capitalism, ho!"
	quest.1998F4B1A5B40B08.title: "Making Money"
