	quest.32FC7B060FC1F330.title: "Sell MV Connector"
	quest.33034B8A714E1A25.quest_desc: [
		"Generating and using electricity is a bit harder than the usual power mods. "
		""
		"To get started we need to make a generator from the Create: Power Grid mod."
		""
		"This tutorial will show you how to make a very basic generator that makes ~240V, capable of powering atleast one Electromagnet."
		""
		"&nYou will need:&r"
		""
		"2x Generator Induction Rotors"
		""
		"Generator Clutch"
		""
		"Generator Commutator"
		""
		"4X Copper Coils (the ones from Powergrid)"
		""
		"8X Generator Housing"
		""
		"8X Shafts"
		""
		"Device Connector"
		""
		"Voltage Gauge (optional just for checking voltage output)"
		""
		"&nStep 1:&r"
		""
		"Connect Clutch to the Induction Rotors and then a Commutator after the Rotors as picture. Rotational energy will be given to the Clutch."
		""
		"{image:quests:textures/quest/step1.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
		""
		"&nStep 2&r"
		""
		"Place the shafts pointing towards the rotors and then right-click a shaft with the coil and connect to the shaft next to it."
		""
		"{image:quests:textures/quest/step2.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
		""
		"&nStep 3&r"
		""
		"Place Generator Housing so it fills the gaps between coils."
		""
		"{image:quests:textures/quest/step3.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
		""
		"&nStep 4&r"
		""
		"Place a device connector ontop of the top coil towards the Commutator. Using wires connect both terminals of the connector to the commutator, then connect from the commutator to your device of choice. Finally supply rotational power to the clutch. If its producing little to no voltage then the rotation is the wrong direction. If it causes a small explosion and the generator coils come off its too fast. I managed 240V with 107 rotational speed."
		""
		"{image:quests:textures/quest/step4.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
	]
	quest.33034B8A714E1A25.quest_subtitle: "With great power comes great responsibility"
	quest.33034B8A714E1A25.title: "Generating Electric"
