	quest.584027F233082265.quest_desc: [
		"A Mechanical Drill is a mechanical component used to break blocks. It can be used to make quarries or used in a cobblestone farm."
		"If a chute is placed under where cobble would generate in a cobblestone farm it will break faster and cause less lag."
		""
		"The Millstone is used to grind items in milling recipes and is a basic version of Crushing Wheels. For example we can grind the cobblestone generated using the mechanical drills into gravel, which in turn can be washed into Flint and Iron Nuggets resulting in automated Iron!"
	]
	quest.584027F233082265.quest_subtitle: "Breaking news"
