	quest.6263FC555EFA4EB1.quest_desc: [
		"&lThere are 2 ways of buying and selling items in Apocalypse Industries.&r"
		""
		"&nExporters/Importers&r"
		""
		"Firstly, the Exporters and Importers from the JacksEconomy mod will likely be your main source of selling and buying items in bulk. "
		""
		"These are set with manifests where you set the item you wish to buy/sell and place that manifest into the machine. These take power either Create rotational force or FE, with the electric powered machines being far faster. "
		""
		"&nQuests&r"
		""
		"Secondly, there are Quests where you can buy and sell items one at a time, however you will need to have exactly the money required. These are useful for buying a single item of to use within a manifest."
	]
